      "writtenOn": "2023-05-02T17:38:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we ought to separate this as two changes. One removing the dead crashing code and following CL that extends the motion_sense tests to cover the case when `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_GESTURE_HOST_DETECTION` is enabled.\n\nI just think the logic/history would be a lot easier to skim/follow.",
      "revId": "7004e06254a492639237b2b9f858c1550b3b91e8",
